Z||000004||Black88GT||05-09-2001||08:08 PM||||That was nothing compared to what you see on the redneck F-Body forums.  For some reason they seem to have a hostility against any non F-body.  I find that the foreign import guys are much more open minded and friendly when talking about Fiero's.  Atleast when those guys don't know anything about the car they admit it, like the one guy on the RX7 forum, but with F-body guys it doesnt matter that they know nothing about the car they will still talk about how it sucks or whatever.||||reg||1
